  "name": "Katatedori Kotegaeshi",
  "description": "Gyaku hanmi katatedori: Uke's left hand on Tori's right wrist. Tori enters beside Uke's front foot and turns tenkan, leading Uke round; Tori's left hand takes the back of Uke's gripping hand, thumb on the back between the knuckles, and Uke lets go. Tori turns back toward Uke, leading the hand in a circle at hip height, then covers it with the right hand and turns it outward — Uke's palm toward Uke, fingers up — stepping back with the left foot. Uke's wrist leads him over backward into ushiro ukemi.",
